# =====================================================
# Cloud Functions Runtime Environment (Optional)
# =====================================================
# Firebase CLI reads `.env` / `.env.legal-102026` from this directory when
# deploying Cloud Functions (`firebase.json` -> `functions[0].configDir`).
#
# By default, no file is required:
#   - Firebase Admin SDK authenticates automatically using Google Cloud's
#     managed Application Default Credentials (no serviceAccount.json).
#   - Production CORS automatically permits `https://legal-102026.web.app` and
#     `https://legal-102026.firebaseapp.com`.
#   - Seeding is permanently disabled in Cloud Functions (`seedOnStart = false`).
#
# Copy this file to `.env.legal-102026` ONLY if you add a custom domain to
# Firebase Hosting and need to allow that additional origin:
#
# CORS_ORIGINS=https://legal-102026.web.app,https://legal-102026.firebaseapp.com,https://your-custom-domain.example.com
